@startuml
' OWNER-MVP-2026-11-04 review: Reference / reusable template. Illustrative contract/model/pattern, not a product release commitment.
allowmixing
title Template example — DTO versus entity versus value object mapping
skinparam backgroundColor white
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam defaultFontName Arial
skinparam classAttributeIconSize 0

class PublishRequestDTO <<transport input>> {
 +resumeId : String
 +expectedVersion : String
 +confirmation : Boolean
}
class PublishIntent <<validated command>>
class ResumeId <<value object>>
class DraftVersion <<value object>>
class ResumeDraft <<entity>>
class PublicationResultDTO <<permitted projection>>
PublishRequestDTO ..> PublishIntent : validate / construct; actor from verified context
PublishIntent --> ResumeId
PublishIntent --> DraftVersion
PublishIntent ..> ResumeDraft : handler resolves current owned state
ResumeDraft ..> PublicationResultDTO : explicit permitted mapping, never raw ORM serialization

@enduml
